<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Auto Group.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Auto Group.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan analyst Mark Husson said he initiated coverage of United Auto Group Inc with a buy rating and a $38-40 12-month price target.</p>
<p>-- &quot;UAG combines the best of the old private franchised dealer group practice, obtaining it preferential position in a continuous supply of high-quality used cars, with professional public company management,&quot; he said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/8 at 26-7/8.</p>
</text>
